OL,3,GNEWSAScaffolding firm fined #20,000
OL,4,Aafter employee fatally injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scaffolding supplier based in County
OL,7,FAntrim has been fined #20,000 after an
OL,8,Femployee was fatally injured at work.
OL,10,FSixty-year-old Samuel Magill had been
OL,11,Fcollecting scaffolding components from
OL,12,Fa construction site on the Lisburn Road
OL,13,Fwhen a metal board struck him on the
OL,14,Fhead in December 2024.
OL,16,FHe was transferred to hospital and
OL,17,Flater died of his injuries on 5
OL,18,FFebruary 2025.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
