OL,3,GNEWSAScaffolding firm fined #20,000
OL,4,Aafter employee fatally injured
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis employer, 7 Towers Scaffolding
OL,7,FLimited, which is based on Millwater
OL,8,FLodge in Ahogill, admitted a charge of
OL,9,Ffailing to ensure the health, safety
OL,10,Fand welfare of all its employees on 18
OL,11,FDecember 2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
